{%- comment -%}
  Converts a YYYY-MM-DD API input string to Unix seconds for storage.
  Include param: due_date_input
  Output: Unix seconds integer, or blank when input is empty.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if due_date_input != blank -%}
{{- due_date_input | strip | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -}}
{%- endif -%}
